  "collectionNotes": [
    "MIPI-DSI / DPI 图像传输未实现，当前不生成替代 framebuffer；产品尺寸/分辨率是硬件知识，不能当作显示运行通过。",
    "旋钮是 GPIO20/21 独立方向开关，一格一个低有效脉冲；使用CW/CCW两个输入，不伪装为正交编码器。PWR经BSS138反相，GPIO2按下为HIGH。CST9217只提供实际报告/分辨率寄存器；未知project/checkcode查询NACK，不能声称完整驱动初始化通过。",
    "CST9217 触摸报告数字子集、I2C GPIO7/8、GPIO35 BOOT 已实现；多点、复杂配置与完整原厂界面未验证。",
    "TF 默认64MiB FAT32与已有P4 SDMMC数字模型；独立原厂文件系统挂载、C6无线、CSI、USB、音频模拟、Ethernet及模拟电源未验收。",
    "此配置使用虚拟 silicon rev3.01，仅用于匹配原始镜像范围；不是实物PCB修订声明，实际芯片应单独识别。",
    "原始出厂镜像固定提交/实际SHA，分区和每个ESP段checksum/SHA已审计；simulationVerified=false，未做本次原厂启动或实机验收。",
    "UIFlow1/2：本轮官方型号README/资源页没有列出精确目标镜像；上游专项核验未知。Xiaozhi可能作为官方Brookesia内部应用出现，但这不证明独立上游镜像可复用。",
    "3D 来源：dimension-photo-reconstruction；生产Three加载器/原生尺寸/屏幕射线/展开复位已检验；部分结构和光学尺寸有明确限制，未宣称浏览器WebGL或实物装配通过。",
    "No hardware-fit or browser/WebGL acceptance is implied by the retained CAD or CPU geometry checks.",
    "Factory display execution is independently recorded in product limitations; a model screen only shows the actual emulator framebuffer.",
    "ColorSKU is represented; packaged battery differences remain knowledge records and are not fabricated as internal geometry.",
    "CW/CCW and BOOT/PWR use product input controls; visual knob ring is not misrepresented as an analog potentiometer.",
    "Official62×30.10mm envelope retained. Flutes,seam,port faces andPWR hotspot are photo-informed visual estimates; no mechanical fit or exact aperture measurements are claimed. Internal boards,motor and optional battery remain UNKNOWN."
  ]
}
